const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文允许预期风险溢价与市场贝塔随时间变化，再检验资产定价关系。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“Tests of Asset Pricing with Time-Varying Expected Risk Premiums and Market Betas” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405X(94)00856-F",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"设计的关键是把时变预期和暴露纳入检验，而不是把静态贝塔当成每一时期的充分描述。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “Tests of Asset Pricing with Time-Varying Expected Risk Premiums and Market Betas”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405X(94)00856-F",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要保留用于估计条件信息、贝塔、市场回报和工具变量的时点与可得性，避免未来信息泄漏。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “Tests of Asset Pricing with Time-Varying Expected Risk Premiums and Market Betas”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405X(94)00856-F",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"时变设定提示静态检验可能遗漏状态依赖，但模型复杂度本身不是对定价关系成立的证明。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “Tests of Asset Pricing with Time-Varying Expected Risk Premiums and Market Betas”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405X(94)00856-F",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结信息集和估计窗口，报告工具变量、参数稳定性及弱识别风险，并区分事后估计与实时可得值。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “Tests of Asset Pricing with Time-Varying Expected Risk Premiums and Market Betas”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405X(94)00856-F",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Financial Economics (1995)。模型的条件性结果不能自动延伸到其他市场结构、资产类别或之后的宏观状态。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Financial Economics (1995) for “Tests of Asset Pricing with Time-Varying Expected Risk Premiums and Market Betas”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405X(94)00856-F",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1995) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Tests of Asset Pricing with Time-Varying Expected Risk Premiums and Market Betas”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。模型的条件性结果不能自动延伸到其他市场结构、资产类别或之后的宏观状态。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Tests of Asset Pricing with Time-Varying Expected Risk Premiums and Market Betas”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
